---
import Cta from "./Cta.astro";
---
<section id="bean" class="strate container" aria-labelledby="bean-title">
  <div class="grid edito">
    <div class="edito-text">
      <div class="rv-up">
        <p class="mini">Chapter 03 · The Bean</p>
        <h2 id="bean-title" class="title-page">Why Puerto Rico, <em>of all places.</em></h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="title-small">Turkish coffee asks more of a bean than any other brewing method. It is ground to the finest powder, unfiltered, and served whole: body, oils, sediment and all.</p>
          <p>A weak coffee falls apart in a cezve. A great one becomes something else entirely.</p>
          <p>Puerto Rican arabica is high-grown, dense, and naturally sweet, and it handles the fine grind better than almost any origin we have tried. It is the unexpected match. And it is grown a short trip from Cincinnati, not halfway around the world.</p>
        </div>
        <Cta class="cta-next" href="#misfits" label="Next: the beans nobody wanted" />
      </div>

      <figure class="fig fig-land bean-fig rv" data-d="1">
        <div class="fig-art">
          <svg class="drawing" viewBox="0 0 150 100" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="40" cy="58" r="24"/>
            <path d="M40 34c0-8 4-15 11-20M51 14c4-3 10-3 14 0-4 4-10 4-14 0Z"/>
            <circle cx="40" cy="79.5" r="1.8"/>
            <path d="M26.5 48.5a16 16 0 0 1 8.5-8.5"/>
            <circle cx="106" cy="56" r="28"/>
            <circle class="soft" cx="106" cy="56" r="23.5"/>
            <path d="M105 36.5c-12 2-18 11-18 19.5s6 17.5 18 19.5ZM107 36.5c12 2 18 11 18 19.5s-6 17.5-18 19.5Z"/>
            <path d="M105 50c-3.2 1.8-3.2 6.2 0 8M107 50c3.2 1.8 3.2 6.2 0 8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="fig-cap mini">Fig. 2 · Coffee cherry<br>Whole and in section</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <dl class="stats">
      <div class="stat rv-up">
        <dt class="mini">Altitude</dt>
        <dd class="stat-value"><span data-count="3200" data-sep=",">3,200</span> ft</dd>
        <dd class="stat-body">High elevation slows ripening and builds sugar density, the foundation of body and foam.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="stat rv-up" data-d="1">
        <dt class="mini">Variety</dt>
        <dd class="stat-value"><span data-count="100">100</span>%</dd>
        <dd class="stat-body">Arabica only. No robusta, no fillers. Just the cleanest expression of the estate.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="stat rv-up">
        <dt class="mini">Roast</dt>
        <dd class="stat-value"><span data-count="7">7</span> days</dd>
        <dd class="stat-body">From roast to cup, never longer than a week. Most Turkish brands measure in months.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="stat rv-up" data-d="1">
        <dt class="mini">Grind</dt>
        <dd class="stat-value">Flour</dd>
        <dd class="stat-body">Finer than espresso. The cezve demands it, and only the right bean survives it.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
